25	/// `Projective` implements Extended Twisted Edwards Coordinates
26	/// as described in [\[HKCD08\]](https://eprint.iacr.org/2008/522.pdf).
27	///
28	/// This implementation uses the unified addition formulae from that paper (see
29	/// Section 3.1).
30	#[derive(Educe)]
